      <dt>How much does a security guard cost in Siliguri per month?</dt>
      <dd>Standard guards in Siliguri are <strong>₹10,000–₹12,000 per month all-inclusive</strong>. Premium tier (corporate office / hotel lobby) is ₹15,000–₹18,000. Armed guards (bank / cash chest) are ₹25,000–₹35,000. Female guards (hospital / school / retail frisking) are ₹12,000–₹15,000. All rates include statutory contributions — EPF, ESI, bonus and gratuity provisioning. Read the full <a href="/blog/cost-security-guards/">cost breakdown article</a>.</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <dt>Are you the best security agency in Siliguri?</dt>
      <dd>We won't claim that — you should evaluate us against the <a href="/blog/choose-security-agency/">12-point checklist</a> we publish. What we will say honestly: we are the largest continuously-owned agency in Siliguri, headquartered here since 2008, deploying 200+ guards in this market every day, with zero compliance penalties on record. Book a free site visit — judge for yourself.</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <dt>How fast can guards start at my Siliguri site?</dt>
      <dd>Within 24 hours of contract signing for any site inside Siliguri municipality. For existing clients, emergency deployment can be in 4 hours. For new clients, a free site visit and written proposal takes 24 hours; once you sign, guards are on post the next working day.</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <dt>Do you provide armed guards in Siliguri?</dt>
      <dd>Yes — licensed armed guards, weapons individually licensed, quarterly handling drills. Common deployments: bank cash-chest, ATM replenishment escort, jewellery showrooms above stock-value thresholds. Pricing ₹25,000–₹35,000 per guard per month. See our <a href="/blog/armed-vs-unarmed/">armed-vs-unarmed buyer's guide</a> first.</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <dt>Do you provide female security guards in Siliguri?</dt>
      <dd>Yes — for hospitals, schools, hostels, retail frisking and women's facilities. Trained female guard pool maintained year-round. ₹12,000–₹15,000 per guard per month. Female frisking guards available on roster for short-duration deployments.</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <dt>What sectors do you secure in Siliguri?</dt>
      <dd>Corporate offices, IT parks, hospitals, hotels (premium and mid-segment), banks and ATMs, retail and malls, schools, residential societies, tea estates (Sevoke / Naxalbari / Bagdogra belt), warehouses, hatcheries, construction sites, telecom infrastructure, events, HNI residences, and government / PSU contracts. Each sector gets a supervisor with sector-specific experience.</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <dt>Do you cover Bagdogra Airport and the airport-corridor businesses?</dt>
      <dd>Yes — Bagdogra, Salugara, Kawakhali, Phulbari and the entire airport-corridor are inside our daily-deployment zone. Hotels, warehouses and retail on this corridor have been long-term clients for over a decade.</dd>
